  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Hurricane is a durable octagonal co-polyester monofilament designed for players who want strong spin, reliable control and long string life at an affordable price. Its lower-density co-polyester construction provides a slightly softer response than firmer polyester strings while maintaining excellent directional control and durability. It is an excellent choice for competitive club players with medium to fast swing speeds.",
    "zh": "Babolat RPM Hurricane 是一款兼顾旋转、控制和耐久性的八边形共聚酯单丝球线，定位于高性价比竞技聚酯线。低密度共聚酯结构让它比传统硬聚酯更加柔和，同时仍然保持优秀的方向控制、旋转能力和耐久表现，非常适合中高级俱乐部比赛球员以及挥拍速度较快的底线型打法。"
  },

